#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:5
msgid "Experienced users"
msgstr "Izkušeni uporabniki"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:9
msgid ""
"Use only following instructions if you know what you are doing... \"The "
"management is not responsible for any case of [...]\" :D"
msgstr ""
"Navodila uporabljajte le, če veste, kaj počnete ... \"Vodstvo ni odgovorno "
"za noben primer [...]\" :D"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:12
msgid "Adapt to your graphical chart"
msgstr "Prilagodite se svojemu grafičnemu grafikonu"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:14
msgid ""
"If you are comfortable with CSS stylesheets, you can adapt Galette CSS to "
"fit your own colors. To achieve that, it is strongly discouraged to edit "
"Galette CSS files, but rather the specific mechanism designed for that. "
"Create a ``galette_local.css`` file in your ``webroot/themes/default`` "
"directory with your styles, it will be automatically included."
msgstr ""
"Če vam je delo s slogovnimi predlogami CSS udobno, lahko prilagodite Galette "
"CSS svojim barvam. Da bi to dosegli, močno odsvetujemo urejanje datotek "
"Galette CSS, temveč uporabo posebnega mehanizma, ki je zasnovan za to. V "
"imeniku ``webroot/themes/default`` ustvarite datoteko ``galette_local.css`` "
"s svojimi slogi, ki bodo samodejno vključene."

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:16
msgid ""
"Try to keep things as simple as possible. For example, if you want to change "
"association name color (displayed under pages titles), you will find in "
"Galette the CSS rule `#asso_name` that defines several parameters including "
"the color. Then, in your stylesheet, you will just need the following:"
msgstr ""
"Poskusite stvari čim bolj poenostaviti. Če želite na primer spremeniti barvo "
"imena asociacije (prikazanega pod naslovi strani), boste v Galette našli "
"pravilo CSS `#asso_name`, ki definira več parametrov, vključno z barvo. Nato "
"boste v svoji slogovni datoteki potrebovali le naslednje:"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:24
msgid ""
"This will be enough to display your association name in red. Note that local "
"CSS file and all issues it may cause will not be taken into account by the "
"Galette team, no support will be provided."
msgstr ""
"To bo dovolj, da se ime vašega združenja prikaže rdeče. Upoštevajte, da "
"ekipa Galette ne bo upoštevala lokalne datoteke CSS in vseh težav, ki jih "
"lahko povzroči, zato vam ne bo zagotovljena nobena podpora."

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:26
msgid ""
"You also can override the print stylesheet, just create a "
"``galette_print_local.css`` file."
msgstr ""
"Slogovno tabelo za tiskanje lahko tudi prepišete, samo ustvarite datoteko "
"``galette_print_local.css``."

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:29
msgid "Add and change strings"
msgstr "Dodajanje in spreminjanje nizov"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:31
msgid ""
"It is possible if needed to customize translated strings in Galette - "
"without editing any Galette source file. Just create a ``galette_{mylang}"
"_local_lang.php`` file (where `{mylang}` must be replaced with the language, "
"like `fr_FR.utf8` or `en_US`) in the ``lang`` directory. This file must "
"contains a simple PHP array with the original string (the one in Galette "
"source code) as index."
msgstr ""
"Po potrebi je mogoče prilagoditi prevedene nize v Galette - brez urejanja "
"izvorne datoteke Galette. Samo ustvarite datoteko ``galette_{mylang}"
"_local_lang.php`` (kjer je treba `{mylang}` zamenjati z jezikom, kot je "
"`fr_FR.utf8` ali `en_US`) v imeniku ``lang``. Ta datoteka mora vsebovati "
"preprosto PHP tabelo z izvirnim nizom (tistim v izvorni kodi Galette) kot "
"indeksom."

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:33
msgid ""
"As example,  we want to change the \"Password\" string on the login page in "
"french, translated as `Mot de passe :`. The original string is `Password:` "
"(see ``galette/templates/default/pages/index.html.twig``), its french "
"translation is `Mot de passe :` and we want to replace it with `Secret :`; "
"so we will create the ``galette_fr_FR.utf8_local_lang.php`` with the "
"following contents:"
msgstr ""
"Na primer, želimo spremeniti niz »Password« na prijavni strani v "
"francoščini, preveden kot `Mot de passe :`. Izvirni niz je `Password:` "
"(glejte ``galette/templates/default/pages/index.html.twig``), njegov "
"francoski prevod je `Mot de passe :` in ga želimo zamenjati s `Secret :`; "
"zato bomo ustvarili ``galette_fr_FR.utf8_local_lang.php`` z naslednjo "
"vsebino:"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:41
msgid ""
"Since Galette uses a cache system for translations, changes may not be "
"visible immediately; you may have to restart PHP (or to clear cache). It is "
"important to take the original string verbatim, punctuation included; and "
"take care to escape single quotes (with a backslash) in all the strings."
msgstr ""
"Ker Galette za prevode uporablja sistem predpomnilnika, spremembe morda ne "
"bodo takoj vidne; morda boste morali znova zagnati PHP (ali počistiti "
"predpomnilnik). Pomembno je, da izvirni niz vzamete dobesedno, vključno z "
"ločili; in pazite, da v vseh nizih uporabite enojne narekovaje (z obračalno "
"poševnico)."

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:43
msgid ""
"You also can override langs for plugins using the same method, just place "
"the file in plugins lang directory and name it ``{plugin}_{mylang}"
"_local_lang.php`` where `{plugin}` is the routing name you can find in the "
"``_define.php`` file."
msgstr ""
"Jezike za vtičnike lahko prepišete tudi z metodo sam. Datoteko preprosto "
"postavite v imenik z jeziki vtičnikov in jo poimenujte ``{plugin}_{mylang}"
"_local_lang.php``, kjer je `{plugin}` ime usmerjanja, ki ga najdete v "
"datoteki ``_define.php``."

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:45
msgid ""
"This will work only if you use Galette translation features, and not with "
"native gettext."
msgstr ""
"To bo delovalo le, če uporabljate prevajalske funkcije Galette in ne z "
"izvornim gettextom."

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:48
msgid "Change session lifetime"
msgstr "Spremeni življenjsko dobo seje"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:52
msgid ""
"The session lifetime is a setting stored in database, "
"``pref_session_timeout``, reachable from the :ref:`advanced configuration "
"<advanced_config>` page. The ``GALETTE_TIMEOUT`` constant still works and "
"still wins over it."
msgstr ""
"Življenjska doba seje je nastavitev, shranjena v bazi podatkov, "
"``pref_session_timeout``, ki je dosegljiva na strani :ref:`napredne "
"konfiguracije <advanced_config>`. Konstanta ``GALETTE_TIMEOUT`` še vedno "
"deluje in jo še vedno premaga."

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:54
msgid ""
"Per default, Galette will create session with default lifetime duration (and "
"it seems browsers act differently in this case). Set "
"``pref_session_timeout`` from the :ref:`advanced configuration "
"<advanced_config>` page to change it; the value is a number of seconds, and "
"``0`` means until the browser is closed."
msgstr ""
"Privzeto bo Galette ustvaril sejo s privzetim trajanjem življenjske dobe (in "
"zdi se, da brskalniki v tem primeru delujejo drugače). Nastavite "
"``pref_session_timeout`` na strani :ref:`napredne konfiguracije "
"<advanced_config>`, da jo spremenite; vrednost je število sekund, ``0`` pa "
"pomeni, da se brskalnik zapre."

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:56
msgid ""
"If the ``GALETTE_TIMEOUT`` constant is still declared in :ref:`behavior "
"configuration <behavior>`, it takes precedence and the setting shows as "
"*locked*. Remove it from that file to manage the lifetime from the page."
msgstr ""
"Če je konstanta ``GALETTE_TIMEOUT`` še vedno deklarirana "
"v :ref:`konfiguraciji vedenja <behavior>`, ima prednost in nastavitev je "
"prikazana kot *zaklenjena*. Odstranite ga iz te datoteke, da upravljate "
"življenjsko dobo s strani."

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:61
msgid "Change maximum upload size"
msgstr ""

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:65
msgid ""
"Each kind of upload has a maximum size of its own, stored in database. It "
"used to be a single value, the same for every one of them, that could only "
"be changed by editing a Galette source file."
msgstr ""

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:67
msgid ""
"Every file Galette accepts has a maximum size, and each kind of upload "
"carries its own setting, reachable from the :ref:`advanced configuration "
"<advanced_config>` page. Values are a number of kilobytes:"
msgstr ""

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:69
msgid ""
"``pref_upload_size_images``: member pictures, association logo and card logo "
"- and the pictures of the plugins that rely on the same mechanism. Defaults "
"to ``2048``,"
msgstr ""

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:70
msgid ""
"``pref_upload_size_attachments``: files attached to an :ref:`e-mailing "
"<emailing>`. Defaults to ``2048``,"
msgstr ""

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:71
msgid ""
"``pref_upload_size_documents``: the documents of the association. Defaults "
"to ``2048``,"
msgstr ""

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:72
msgid ""
"``pref_upload_size_imports``: the CSV files handed to the members import. "
"Defaults to ``2048``,"
msgstr ""

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:73
msgid ""
"``pref_upload_size_dynamic_files``: the files stored in a :ref:`dynamic "
"field <dynamic_fields>` that declares no size of its own. A field that "
"declares one uses it instead. Defaults to ``1024``."
msgstr ""

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:75
msgid ""
"Limits are in kilobytes; and displayed in the unit that fits, so the "
"``2048`` above reads as *2 Mo*."
msgstr ""

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:79
msgid ""
"PHP has the last word. A file bigger than ``upload_max_filesize``, or a form "
"bigger than ``post_max_size``, never reaches Galette whatever these settings "
"say, and both are counted in a couple of megabytes in most PHP "
"installations. Raise them in your ``php.ini`` first, otherwise the only "
"thing you get is an error Galette never sees."
msgstr ""

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:81
msgid ""
"Attachments deserve a thought of their own before you raise them: a heavy "
"file is sent to **every** recipient of the mailing, it weighs on your own "
"mail server as much as on theirs, and it makes the message more likely to be "
"taken for spam. A link to the file is often a better idea than the file "
"itself."
msgstr ""

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:87
msgid "Log IP addresses behind a proxy"
msgstr "Beleženje IP-naslovov za posredniškim strežnikom"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:89
msgid ""
"If your Galette instance is behind a proxy, IP address stored in history "
"will be the proxy one, and not the user one :("
msgstr ""
"Če je vaš primerek Galette za posredniškim strežnikom, bo v zgodovini "
"shranjen IP naslov posredniškega strežnika in ne uporabniški :("

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:93
msgid ""
"The proxy depth is a setting stored in database, "
"``pref_x_forwarded_for_index``, reachable from the :ref:`advanced "
"configuration <advanced_config>` page. The ``GALETTE_X_FORWARDED_FOR_INDEX`` "
"constant still works and still wins over it."
msgstr ""
"Globina proxyja je nastavitev, shranjena v zbirki podatkov, "
"``pref_x_forwarded_for_index``, dosegljiva na strani :ref:`napredne "
"konfiguracije <advanced_config>`. Konstanta "
"``GALETTE_X_FORWARDED_FOR_INDEX`` še vedno deluje in jo še vedno premaga."

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:95
msgid ""
"To fix that, set ``pref_x_forwarded_for_index`` from the :ref:`advanced "
"configuration <advanced_config>` page. Each proxy server appends its own "
"address to the header, and the value is the position to read from the "
"**end** of the list, starting at ``1``. So ``1`` is what you want behind a "
"single reverse proxy, and ``0`` - the default - disables the lookup entirely."
msgstr ""
"Če želite to popraviti, nastavite ``pref_x_forwarded_for_index`` na "
"strani :ref:`napredne konfiguracije <advanced_config>`. Vsak strežnik proxy "
"glavi doda svoj naslov, vrednost pa je položaj za branje od **konca** "
"seznama, začenši pri ``1``. Torej je ``1`` tisto, kar želite za enim "
"povratnim proxyjem, ``0`` - privzeto - v celoti onemogoči iskanje."

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:99
msgid ""
"For security reasons, leave it to ``0`` if your instance is not behind a "
"proxy! Anyone could otherwise send an ``X-Forwarded-For`` header of their "
"own and have it logged in place of their address."
msgstr ""
"Iz varnostnih razlogov ga pustite na ``0``, če vaš primerek ni za "
"posrednikom! Vsakdo bi sicer lahko poslal lastno glavo ``X-Forwarded-For`` "
"in jo zabeležil namesto svojega naslova."

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:101
msgid ""
"If the ``GALETTE_X_FORWARDED_FOR_INDEX`` constant is still declared "
"in :ref:`behavior configuration <behavior>`, it takes precedence and the "
"setting shows as *locked*."
msgstr ""
"Če je konstanta ``GALETTE_X_FORWARDED_FOR_INDEX`` še vedno deklarirana "
"v :ref:`konfiguraciji vedenja <behavior>`, ima prednost in nastavitev je "
"prikazana kot *zaklenjena*."

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:104
msgid "External stats"
msgstr "Zunanja statistika"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:108
msgid ""
"Many statistics platforms rely on an extra  Javascript block to work. You "
"can create a ``tracking.js`` file under ``webroot/themes/default`` "
"directory, it will be automatically included."
msgstr ""
"Številne statistične platforme za delovanje potrebujejo dodaten blok "
"Javascript. Datoteko ``tracking.js`` lahko ustvarite v imeniku ``webroot/"
"themes/default``, ki bo samodejno vključena."

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:110
msgid ""
"Galette uses Javascript to work. If the code you add in the ``tracking.js`` "
"file is incorrect, this may break Galette!"
msgstr ""
"Galette za delovanje uporablja Javascript. Če je koda, ki jo dodate v "
"datoteko ``tracking.js``, napačna, lahko to povzroči okvaro Galette!"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:113
msgid "CSV exports"
msgstr "Izvozi CSV"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:117
msgid ""
"You can setup parameted exports with a `YAML <https://yaml.org/>`_ file "
"instead of an XML one."
msgstr ""
"Izvoz parametrov lahko nastavite z datoteko `YAML <https://yaml.org/>`_ "
"namesto z datoteko XML."

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:119
msgid ""
"Galette provides a parameted CSV exports system. Only one parameted export "
"is provided, but you can add your own to the ``config/exports.yaml`` file."
msgstr ""
"Galette ponuja sistem za parametriziran izvoz CSV. Na voljo je samo en "
"parametriziran izvoz, vendar lahko v datoteko ``config/exports.yaml`` dodate "
"svojega."

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:123
msgid ""
"Legacy XML configuration file is still supported; if a duplicate identifier "
"is found, YAML file takes precedence."
msgstr ""
"Starejša konfiguracijska datoteka XML je še vedno podprta; če je najden "
"podvojen identifikator, ima prednost datoteka YAML."

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:125
msgid "Let's examine existing \"cotisations\" parameted export:"
msgstr "Oglejmo si obstoječe parametrizirane izvozne storitve \"kotizacije\":"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:149
msgid ""
"each array entry is a unique identifier, lowercase without spaces or special "
"character"
msgstr ""
"Vsak vnos v polje je enolični identifikator, napisan z malimi črkami brez "
"presledkov ali posebnih znakov"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:150
msgid ""
"`name` and `description` are mandatory as used to display each parameted "
"export in the user interface"
msgstr ""
"Polja `name` in `description` sta obvezna, saj se uporabljata za prikaz "
"vsakega parametriziranega izvoza v uporabniškem vmesniku"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:151
msgid "`filename` sets the filename for output file"
msgstr "`filename` nastavi ime datoteke za izhodno datoteko"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:152
msgid ""
"`query` is the query to execute, it's mandatory. There is no other "
"limitation than the SQL engine ones, expect you cannot send them any "
"parameters"
msgstr ""
"`query` je poizvedba, ki jo je treba izvesti, je obvezna. Ni drugih omejitev "
"razen omejitev mehanizma SQL, razen da jim ne morete poslati nobenih "
"parametrov"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:153
msgid "`headers` manages columns titles:"
msgstr "`headers` upravlja naslove stolpcev:"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:155
msgid "like in the above example, an array of columns titles of your own"
msgstr "kot v zgornjem primeru, polje z lastnimi naslovi stolpcev"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:156
msgid ""
"if not present, Galette fields names will be exported. You can use named "
"columns in your SQL query (``SELECT nom_adh AS \"Column title\" FROM ...``)"
msgstr ""
"Če ni prisotno, bodo imena polj Galette izvožena. V poizvedbi SQL lahko "
"uporabite poimenovane stolpce (``SELECT nom_adh AS \"Naslov stolpca\" "
"FROM ...``)"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:157
msgid "set to false (``headers: false``) to disable column headers output"
msgstr ""
"nastavite na false (``headers: false``), da onemogočite izpis glav stolpcev"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:159
msgid ""
"`separator` is the CSV separator that will be used. Possible values are:"
msgstr "`separator` je ločilo CSV, ki bo uporabljeno. Možne vrednosti so:"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:161
msgid "semicolon (``;``) - default"
msgstr "podpičje (``;``) - privzeto"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:162
msgid "comma (``,``)"
msgstr "vejica (``,``)"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:163
msgid "tabulation character (``\\t``)"
msgstr "znak za tabelacijo (``\\t``)"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:165
msgid "`quote` either double quote - default - or simple quote character"
msgstr "`quote` bodisi dvojni narekovaj – privzeto – bodisi preprost narekovaj"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:166
msgid "to disable an export, you can add ``inactive: true``"
msgstr "Če želite onemogočiti izvoz, lahko dodate ``inactive: true``"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:171
msgid "Administration tools"
msgstr "Orodja za upravljanje"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:175
msgid ""
"All the admin tools operations are destructive, use them with caution, and "
"**make sure you did a database backup** before!"
msgstr ""
"Vse operacije skrbniških orodij so uničujoče, uporabljajte jih previdno in "
"**prepričajte se, da ste pred tem naredili varnostno kopijo baze podatkov**!"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:177
msgid "There are a few tools provided for Galette admin that permits to:"
msgstr "Za skrbnika Galette je na voljo nekaj orodij, ki omogočajo:"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:179
msgid ""
"**reinitialize mailings contents** will reset all emails contents to default "
"values,"
msgstr ""
"**ponovna inicializacija vsebine e-poštnih sporočil** ponastavi vsebino vseh "
"e-poštnih sporočil na privzete vrednosti,"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:180
msgid ""
"**reinitialize fields configuration** will reset all members core fields to "
"their default value. This does not imply dynamic fields,"
msgstr ""
"**Konfiguracija ponovne inicializacije polj** bo ponastavila vsa osnovna "
"polja članov na privzete vrednosti. To ne pomeni dinamičnih polj,"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:181
msgid ""
"**reinitialize PDF models** will reset all PDF models to default values,"
msgstr ""
"**Ponovna inicializacija modelov PDF** bo ponastavila vse modele PDF na "
"privzete vrednosti,"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:182
msgid ""
"**generate empty logins and passwords** those information are required to "
"improve security, but sometimes missing (if you import a CSV for example). "
"This feature will set random values as login and password fields that would "
"be empty in database."
msgstr ""
"**generiraj prazna uporabniška imena in gesla**. Ti podatki so potrebni za "
"izboljšanje varnosti, vendar včasih manjkajo (na primer, če uvozite datoteko "
"CSV). Ta funkcija bo nastavila naključne vrednosti kot polja za prijavo in "
"geslo, ki bi bila v zbirki podatkov prazna."

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:183
msgid ""
"**Fix dynamic fields dates format** will convert all dynamic fields dates to "
"the new format (see :ref:`dynamic fields <dynamic_fields>`)."
msgstr ""
"**Popravi obliko datumov dinamičnih polj** bo pretvorila vse datume "
"dinamičnih polj v novo obliko (glejte :ref:`dynamic fields "
"<dynamic_fields>`)."

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:188
msgid "Draining the mail queue"
msgstr ""

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:194
msgid "Use **one** drainer at a time!"
msgstr ""

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:196
msgid ""
"Nothing prevents two of them from picking the same pending recipients at the "
"same moment, message would be sent twice - and that could cause other errors "
"anyway."
msgstr ""

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:198
msgid ""
"As soon as an hourly or daily :ref:`sending limit <mail_throttling>` is set, "
"Galette stops sending mass mailings and reminders in a single page load. It "
"queues one entry per recipient in database, and drains that queue "
"progressively."
msgstr ""

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:200
msgid ""
"The progress page does it from your browser, which is enough most of the "
"time, but it requires that page to stay open. Two other drainers are "
"provided, and neither needs anybody to be logged in."
msgstr ""

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:202
msgid "A cron script, next to the reminders one:"
msgstr ""

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:208
msgid "And a console command, :doc:`from the command line </command-line>`:"
msgstr ""

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:214
msgid ""
"The command asks for confirmation before sending anything, since the feature "
"is still in alpha. Add ``--force`` to skip the question, which is what a "
"cron entry calling the command would need."
msgstr ""

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:216
msgid ""
"Both send batch after batch, waiting the configured delay between two "
"messages, until the queue is empty or the quota is reached. They stop rather "
"than wait for the quota window to open again, so what is left goes out on "
"the next run: calling them regularly is the whole point."
msgstr ""

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:220
msgid ""
"Like the reminders script, ``cron/mailing_queue.php`` needs the address of "
"your instance, since it runs with no incoming request to guess it from. Set "
"``pref_galette_url`` from the :ref:`advanced configuration "
"<advanced_config>`, or keep the ``GALETTE_URI`` constant."
msgstr ""

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:225
msgid "Advanced configuration"
msgstr "Napredna konfiguracija"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:229
msgid ""
"The settings form only shows a curated set of settings. The **Configuration "
"> Advanced configuration** entry lists them **all**, one row per setting, "
"including those that have no place on the form and those that used to be "
"reachable only by editing a PHP file."
msgstr ""
"Obrazec z nastavitvami prikazuje samo izbran nabor nastavitev. Vnos "
"**Konfiguracija > Napredna konfiguracija** navaja **vse**, po eno vrstico na "
"nastavitev, vključno s tistimi, ki nimajo mesta na obrazcu, in tistimi, ki "
"so bili včasih dosegljivi samo z urejanjem datoteke PHP."

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:233
msgid ""
"This page can break your installation, be very careful. Values are checked, "
"but a setting that is perfectly valid can still be wrong for your instance, "
"and nothing asks you to confirm before storing it."
msgstr ""
"Ta stran lahko prekine vašo namestitev, bodite zelo previdni. Vrednosti so "
"preverjene, vendar je nastavitev, ki je popolnoma veljavna, lahko še vedno "
"napačna za vaš primerek in nič ne zahteva potrditve pred shranjevanjem."

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:235
msgid "Galette advanced configuration"
msgstr "Napredna konfiguracija Galette"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:240
msgid ""
"Only the super administrator can reach the page, and the password is asked "
"again before it opens. The confirmation is remembered for fifteen minutes; "
"after that, or after a new login, it is asked again."
msgstr ""
"Samo superskrbnik lahko doseže stran, pred odpiranjem pa se znova vpraša za "
"geslo. Potrditev se zapomni za petnajst minut; po tem ali po novi prijavi se "
"ponovno vpraša."

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:242
msgid "Password asked before the advanced configuration page opens"
msgstr "Zahtevano geslo, preden se odpre stran z napredno konfiguracijo"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:247
msgid ""
"Settings are saved **one at a time**: each row has its own **Save** button, "
"and a **Reset to default** button appears as soon as the value differs from "
"the one Galette ships with. Nothing is submitted for the whole page, so a "
"mistake on one row cannot take the others with it."
msgstr ""
"Nastavitve se shranjujejo **ena za drugo**: vsaka vrstica ima svoj gumb "
"**Shrani** in gumb **Ponastavi na privzeto** se prikaže takoj, ko se "
"vrednost razlikuje od tiste, ki jo pošilja Galette. Nič ni predloženo za "
"celotno stran, zato napaka v eni vrstici ne more odnesti drugih s seboj."

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:249
msgid ""
"A value goes through the very same checks as the settings form, and is "
"refused with the same messages: a number outside its bounds, a malformed "
"email address, but also a change that would break a rule *between* settings, "
"such as setting both a membership extension and a fixed beginning of "
"membership."
msgstr ""
"Vrednost gre skozi enaka preverjanja kot obrazec za nastavitve in je "
"zavrnjena z istimi sporočili: številka zunaj njenih meja, napačno oblikovan "
"e-poštni naslov, pa tudi sprememba, ki bi kršila pravilo *med* nastavitvami, "
"kot je nastavitev podaljšanja članstva in fiksnega začetka članstva."

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:251
msgid ""
"A search field above the table filters the rows on the setting name. It "
"needs Javascript; without it the whole list is displayed."
msgstr ""
"Iskalno polje nad tabelo filtrira vrstice z imenom nastavitve. Potrebuje "
"Javascript; brez njega se prikaže celoten seznam."

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:253
msgid "Each row carries a status, also recalled in the page legend:"
msgstr "Vsaka vrstica ima status, ki je priklican tudi v legendi strani:"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:255
msgid "**default**: never changed, the value Galette ships with,"
msgstr "**privzeto**: nikoli spremenjeno, vrednost, ki jo pošilja Galette,"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:256
msgid ""
"**modified**: changed from the default, here or from the settings form. It "
"can be reset,"
msgstr ""
"**spremenjeno**: spremenjeno s privzetega, tukaj ali iz obrazca za "
"nastavitve. Lahko se ponastavi,"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:257
msgid ""
"**read-only**: Galette maintains this value itself, such as a generated "
"identifier or a date it records. It is shown for information only,"
msgstr ""
"**samo za branje**: Galette sama vzdržuje to vrednost, na primer ustvarjeni "
"identifikator ali datum, ki ga zabeleži. Prikazan je samo informativno,"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:258
msgid ""
"**secret**: a password or a token. Its value is never displayed, only "
"whether one is set, and it is changed from the settings form,"
msgstr ""
"**skrivnost**: geslo ali žeton. Njena vrednost ni nikoli prikazana, samo, "
"ali je ena nastavljena, in se spremeni iz obrazca za nastavitve,"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:259
msgid ""
"**locked**: a constant declared in :ref:`behavior.inc.php <behavior>` takes "
"precedence over the stored value. Remove it from that file to manage the "
"setting from here,"
msgstr ""
"**zaklenjeno**: konstanta, deklarirana v :ref:`behavior.inc.php <behavior>`, "
"ima prednost pred shranjeno vrednostjo. Odstranite ga iz te datoteke, če "
"želite upravljati nastavitev od tu,"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:260
msgid ""
"**unknown**: a row found in database that Galette does not describe. It may "
"come from an older version or from a plugin. It is displayed, never edited."
msgstr ""
"**neznano**: vrstica, najdena v bazi podatkov, ki je Galette ne opisuje. "
"Morda prihaja iz starejše različice ali iz vtičnika. Je prikazan, nikoli "
"urejen."

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:262
msgid ""
"A setting can also carry an **alpha** label, on top of its status. It drives "
"a feature that has not been through a release yet: it works, but it has seen "
"little use. Try it on a test instance before your production one, and "
"`report what you find <https://bugs.galette.eu>`_."
msgstr ""

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:264
msgid "The statuses a setting can carry"
msgstr "Stanja, ki jih lahko nosi nastavitev"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:269
msgid ""
"A setting only shows an input when it can be edited from there. In the "
"example below, ``pref_x_forwarded_for_index`` is locked by a constant and "
"only displays what applies, while ``pref_session_timeout``, right after it, "
"is editable:"
msgstr ""
"Nastavitev prikaže vnos le, če ga je mogoče tam urejati. V spodnjem primeru "
"je ``pref_x_forwarded_for_index`` zaklenjen s konstanto in prikazuje samo "
"tisto, kar velja, medtem ko je ``pref_session_timeout``, takoj za njim, "
"mogoče urejati:"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:271
msgid "A locked setting, and an editable one"
msgstr "Zaklenjena nastavitev in možnost urejanja"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:276
msgid ""
"A second table, below the settings, lists the constants ``behavior.inc.php`` "
"understands, whether each one is currently declared, and what it is set to. "
"It is there so you can see how the instance is configured without opening "
"the file. A constant a setting now replaces only appears in that table while "
"it is declared, along with a link to the setting it overrides."
msgstr ""
"Druga tabela pod nastavitvami navaja konstante, ki jih ``behavior.inc.php`` "
"razume, ali je vsaka trenutno deklarirana in na kaj je nastavljena. Tam je, "
"da lahko vidite, kako je primerek konfiguriran, ne da bi odprli datoteko. "
"Konstanta, ki jo zdaj nadomešča nastavitev, se v tej tabeli pojavi le, ko je "
"deklarirana, skupaj s povezavo do nastavitve, ki jo preglasi."

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:278
msgid "Constants behavior.inc.php understands"
msgstr "Konstante behavior.inc.php razume"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:286
msgid "Galette modes"
msgstr "Galettejevi načini"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:288
msgid ""
"Several modes are provided in Galette you can configure with "
"``GALETTE_MODE`` constant (:ref:`see Galette behavior configuration "
"<behavior>`). This directive can take the following values:"
msgstr ""
"V Galette je na voljo več načinov, ki jih lahko konfigurirate s konstanto "
"``GALETTE_MODE`` (:ref:`glejte konfiguracija vedenja Galette <behavior>`). "
"Ta direktiva lahko sprejme naslednje vrednosti:"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:290
msgid ""
"``PROD``: production mode (non production instance should be on another "
"mode). This is the default mode for releases, but it may change in "
"development branch."
msgstr ""
"``PROD``: produkcijski način (neprodukcijski primerek mora biti v drugem "
"načinu). To je privzeti način za izdaje, vendar se lahko v razvojni veji "
"spremeni."

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:291
msgid ""
"``DEMO``: demonstration mode, the same as ``PROD`` but with some features "
"disabled like sending emails, modifying superadmin data, ..."
msgstr ""
"``DEMO``: demonstracijski način, enak kot ``PROD``, vendar z nekaterimi "
"onemogočenimi funkcijami, kot so pošiljanje e-pošte, spreminjanje podatkov "
"superadministratorja, ..."

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:292
msgid "``TEST``: reserved for unit tests."
msgstr "``TEST``: rezervirano za enotne teste."

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:293
msgid "``MAINT``: maintenance mode. Only super admin will be able to login."
msgstr ""
"``MAINT``: vzdrževalni način. Prijavil se bo lahko samo super administrator."

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:298
msgid "Galette Debug"
msgstr "Odpravljanje napak v Galette"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:302
msgid ""
"A dedicated constant name ``GALETTE_DEBUG`` can be used to enable debug "
"mode. With this mode on:"
msgstr ""
"Za omogočanje načina za odpravljanje napak se lahko uporabi namenska "
"konstanta z imenom ``GALETTE_DEBUG``. Ko je ta način vklopljen:"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:304
msgid "unstable/not finished parts will be activated,"
msgstr "aktivirani bodo nestabilni/nedokončani deli,"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:305
msgid "some data will not be stored in session,"
msgstr "nekateri podatki ne bodo shranjeni med sejo,"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:306
msgid "default log level is set to ``DEBUG``,"
msgstr "privzeta raven dnevnika je nastavljena na ``DEBUG``,"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:307
msgid "news won't be cached,"
msgstr "novice ne bodo shranjene v predpomnilnik,"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:308
msgid "database version check will not be done."
msgstr "Preverjanje različice baze podatkov ne bo opravljeno."

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:314
msgid "Behavior configuration"
msgstr "Konfiguracija vedenja"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:316
msgid ""
"Some of Galette behaviors are set by declaring constants in the ``galette/"
"config/behavior.inc.php`` file. A commented example of every one of them "
"ships as ``behavior.inc.php.dist``, next to it."
msgstr ""
"Nekatera vedenja Galette so nastavljena z deklaracijo konstant v datoteki "
"``galette/config/behavior.inc.php``. Komentiran primer vsakega od njih je "
"poleg ``behavior.inc.php.dist``."

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:318
msgid "For example:"
msgstr "Na primer:"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:327
msgid ""
"Only the settings Galette needs **before it can reach database** are still "
"declared here. The others became regular settings, editable from "
"the :ref:`advanced configuration <advanced_config>` page."
msgstr ""
"Tukaj so še vedno deklarirane samo nastavitve, ki jih Galette potrebuje "
"**preden lahko doseže bazo podatkov**. Druge so postale običajne nastavitve, "
"ki jih je mogoče urejati na strani :ref:`napredna konfiguracija "
"<advanced_config>`."

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:329
msgid "The following settings can be set:"
msgstr "Nastavite lahko naslednje nastavitve:"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:331
msgid "``GALETTE_DEBUG``: enable debug mode, :ref:`see Galette debug <debug>`,"
msgstr ""
"``GALETTE_DEBUG``: omogoči način odpravljanja napak, :ref:`glejte Galette "
"debug <debug>`,"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:332
msgid ""
"``GALETTE_MODE``: instance mode, :ref:`see Galette modes <galettemodes>`,"
msgstr ""
"``GALETTE_MODE``: način primerka, :ref:`glejte načine Galette "
"<galettemodes>`,"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:333
msgid ""
"``GALETTE_LOG_LVL``: verbosity of the logs, as an `Analog <https://"
"github.com/jbroadway/analog>`_ level. Defaults to ``WARNING``, or ``DEBUG`` "
"in debug mode,"
msgstr ""
"``GALETTE_LOG_LVL``: podrobnost dnevnikov, kot raven `Analog <https://"
"github.com/jbroadway/analog>`_. Privzeto je ``OPOZORILO`` ali ``DEBUG`` v "
"načinu za odpravljanje napak,"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:334
msgid ""
"``GALETTE_SQL_DEBUG``: dump every SQL query to ``data/logs/galette_sql.log``,"
msgstr ""
"``GALETTE_SQL_DEBUG``: izpiši vsako SQL poizvedbo v ``data/logs/"
"galette_sql.log``,"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:335
msgid ""
"``GALETTE_FEATURE_FLAGS``: development features to activate, as an array. "
"They only apply in debug mode."
msgstr ""
"``GALETTE_FEATURE_FLAGS``: razvojne funkcije za aktiviranje kot niz. "
"Uporabljajo se samo v načinu za odpravljanje napak."

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:338
msgid "Settings that moved"
msgstr "Nastavitve, ki so se premaknile"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:342
msgid ""
"Three settings that used to be declared here are now stored in database, and "
"edited from the :ref:`advanced configuration <advanced_config>` page:"
msgstr ""
"Tri nastavitve, ki so bile prej navedene tukaj, so zdaj shranjene v zbirki "
"podatkov in se urejajo na strani :ref:`napredna konfiguracija "
"<advanced_config>`:"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:344
msgid "``GALETTE_URI`` became ``pref_galette_url``,"
msgstr "``GALETTE_URI`` je postal ``pref_galette_url``,"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:345
msgid ""
"``GALETTE_X_FORWARDED_FOR_INDEX`` became "
"``pref_x_forwarded_for_index``, :ref:`see logging IP addresses behind a "
"proxy <proxy_ip>`,"
msgstr ""
"``GALETTE_X_FORWARDED_FOR_INDEX`` je postal "
"``pref_x_forwarded_for_index``, :ref:`glej beleženje naslovov IP za proxyjem "
"<proxy_ip>`,"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:346
msgid "``GALETTE_TIMEOUT`` became ``pref_session_timeout``."
msgstr "``GALETTE_TIMEOUT`` je postal ``pref_session_timeout``."

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:348
msgid ""
"Declaring one of them still works, and **still takes precedence over the "
"stored value**: nothing breaks on upgrade. Galette then writes a warning in "
"its logs, and the advanced configuration page shows the setting as *locked*, "
"naming the constant responsible. Remove it from ``behavior.inc.php`` to "
"manage the setting from the page."
msgstr ""
"Razglasitev enega od njih še vedno deluje in **ima še vedno prednost pred "
"shranjeno vrednostjo**: pri nadgradnji se nič ne pokvari. Galette nato "
"zapiše opozorilo v svoje dnevnike, stran z napredno konfiguracijo pa prikaže "
"nastavitev kot *zaklenjeno* in poimenuje odgovorno konstanto. Odstranite ga "
"iz ``behavior.inc.php``, če želite upravljati nastavitev s strani."

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:352
msgid ""
"``pref_galette_url`` is the one setting the :ref:`reminders cron script "
"<reminders>` cannot do without: it runs with no incoming request, so it has "
"no way of guessing the address of your instance. Set it - or keep the "
"constant - if you automate reminders."
msgstr ""
"``pref_galette_url`` je tisti, ki nastavi :ref:`reminders cron skript "
"<reminders>` brez katerega ne more: deluje brez dohodne zahteve, tako da ne "
"more uganiti naslova vašega primerka. Če avtomatizirate opomnike, ga "
"nastavite - ali ohranite konstantno."

